sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 浏览器
    participant V as Vite Proxy
    participant H as Hono Routes
    participant M as Auth MW
    participant D as Domain Lib
    participant K as Kimi LLM
    participant S as SiliconFlow
    participant T as 火山 TTS
    participant A as 火山 ASR
    participant DB as SQLite

    rect rgba(96,165,250,0.08)
    Note over U,DB: 1) 普通 HTTP 请求（含登录态）
    U->>V: fetch('/api/...', cookie)
    V->>H: 转发 (dev only)
    H->>M: 解析 session
    M-->>H: user 注入 ctx
    H->>D: 业务调用
    D->>DB: 读/写 (WAL)
    DB-->>D: rows
    D-->>H: 数据
    H-->>U: ApiResponse(T)
    end

    rect rgba(167,139,250,0.08)
    Note over U,DB: 2) 训练面试 — LLM 流式 + 语音双工
    U->>H: POST /api/training/start
    H->>D: training/state-machine
    D->>DB: 写入 session
    D->>K: chat (SSE 流)
    K-->>D: token chunks
    D-->>U: SSE 流回写问题
    U->>U: 文本转 TTS 请求
    U->>H: POST /api/voice/tts (text)
    H->>T: WSS 二进制帧
    T-->>H: audio chunks
    H-->>U: 音频流
    U-->>U: 播放并录音
    U->>H: WS /api/voice/asr (PCM 帧)
    H->>A: WSS 二进制转发
    A-->>H: 文本片段
    H-->>U: 实时 transcript
    U->>H: POST /api/training/answer
    H->>D: 评分 + 状态推进
    D->>K: 复盘 prompt (异步)
    K-->>D: review
    D->>DB: 持久化 review
    end

    rect rgba(52,211,153,0.08)
    Note over U,DB: 3) Explore 检索 — 向量召回 + 重排
    U->>H: GET /api/explore/search?q=...
    H->>D: explore/recommender
    D->>S: embedding(query) (HTTPS)
    S-->>D: query vec
    D->>DB: ANN candidates
    D->>S: rerank(query, docs)
    S-->>D: rerank scores
    D-->>H: 排序后聚合 hub
    H-->>U: ApiResponse
    end
